  "description": "Western Season is a bold western display font inspired by vintage cowboy style and the spirit of the Wild West. Featuring sharp serifs and rugged details, this typeface captures a rustic, adventurous, and retro vibe. Perfect for posters, logos, bar signage, rodeo events, country music designs, vintage packaging, and apparel, Western Season will give your project a strong western flair and authentic old west character.",
